  "description": "Soft starter with Modbus RTU through the SSW900-CRS485-W accessory: measurements, status and control words, start and stop settings, motor data and serial settings",
  "revision": 1,
  "revised": "2026-11-10",
  "source": "WEG SSW900-CRS485-W Modbus RTU user's manual V1.6X, document 10004628735 rev. 06",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "WEG SSW900-CRS485-W Modbus RTU manual do usuário (V1.6X)",
      "version": "10004628735 / R06",
      "date": "2024-10",
      "url": "https://static.weg.net/medias/downloadcenter/hdc/he5/WEG-manual-modbus-rtu-10004628735-SSW900-pt.pdf",
      "note": "linked in issue #193; memory map and table 10.2 (Net Id of each parameter)"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The soft starter needs the SSW900-CRS485-W accessory for Modbus RTU. Every parameter is the holding register whose number is its Net Id (table 10.2 of the manual); the Modicon address is 40001 + the number.",
    "Values travel as integers without decimals: a current of 12.3 A is sent as 123. Scales follow the decimal places column of table 10.2.",
    "32-bit values (currents, powers, serial number, energy, hours) use two registers with the least significant word first, so word_order is little.",
    "The manual lists 8-bit parameters; they are read and written as one register each.",
    "Only the most used parameters are listed, not the full table 10.2. Other parameters can be added the same way (register = Net Id).",
    "The parameter numbers (S1.1.1 and so on) in the descriptions are the menu codes of the manual.",
    "The manual is in Portuguese; the English edition for V1.4X (document 10004628707) could not be downloaded. Written from the manufacturer's document; not tested on a device."
  ],
